images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/24px-Duration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/36px-Duration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/48px-Duration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/24px-Duration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Duration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>Until long rest</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/36px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Hit Points</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>22</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/36px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Armour Class</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>8</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slam_(Animate_Dead_Zombie)\" title=\"Slam (Animate Dead Zombie)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp/40px-Slam_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp/60px-Slam_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp/80px-Slam_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp/40px-Slam_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slam_(Animate_Dead_Zombie)\" title=\"Slam (Animate Dead Zombie)\">Slam</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Hit a target with your bare fists and infect it with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crawling_Gnaw_(Condition)\" title=\"Crawling Gnaw (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crawling Gnaw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crawling_Gnaw_(Condition)\" title=\"Crawling Gnaw (Condition)\">Crawling Gnaw</a></span>. </dd>\n</dl>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead\" title=\"Animate Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp/60px-Animate_Dead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp/80px-Animate_Dead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead\" title=\"Animate Dead\">Animate Dead</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This zombie applies a condition called <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crawling_Gnaw_(Condition)\" title=\"Crawling Gnaw (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crawling Gnaw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Crawling_Gnaw_(Condition)\" title=\"Crawling Gnaw (Condition)\">Crawling Gnaw</a>. If an enemy is killed while having this condition, a <a href=\"/wiki/Newborn_Zombie\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Newborn Zombie\">Newborn Zombie</a> is automatically spawned from their corpse.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041141\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.091 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.095 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3361/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 70165/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 26599/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1455343/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n125.12%   98.378     35 Template:Trim\n100.00% 